#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksirtet; is a clone of the well known game <application>Tetris</"
"application>. You must fit the falling pieces to form full lines. You can "
"rotate and translate the falling piece. The game ends when no more pieces "
"can fall, &ie; when your incomplete lines reach the top of the board."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every time you have destroyed 10 lines, you advance to the next level and "
"the pieces fall quicker (to be precise, the pieces fall from the top of the "
"screen each <literal>1/(1+level)</literal> second)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handling the Falling Piece"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the keyboard to rotate, translate or drop down the falling "
"piece. The keys are configurable via the menu item "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Types"
msgstr "የጨዋታ አይነት፦"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksirtet; supports two types of single player game: Normal and Arcade. In "
"Normal mode, points totals are kept, and high scores recorded. Also, when "
"advancing to the next level, play continues without clearing the gameboard. "
"In Arcade mode, no points totals are kept, although an <guilabel>Elapsed "
"time</guilabel> counter is shown. When you advance to the next level in "
"Arcade mode, the gameboard is cleared of pieces."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can choose the game mode in the <guimenu>Mode</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to gain Points"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two sources of points:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Dropping down a piece using the <keysym>Down Arrow</keysym> gives a small "
"number of points which is equal to the drop height. It is not much each time "
"but is particularly relevant in the earlier levels, when the pieces fall "
"more slowly."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The biggest part of the score comes from destroying full lines. It is very "
"important to note that destroying multiple lines at the same time gives you "
"a lot more points. A four-lines destruction is called a <quote>tetris</"
"quote>: it gives a maximum amount of points."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The points gained are 40 for a one-liner, 100 for two lines, 300 for three "
"lines and 1200 for a tetris. These numbers are multiplied by the current "
"level. For example, destroying four lines in level 10 gives 12,000 points."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &ksirtet;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &ksirtet; configuration is accessed from the menu item "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &ksirtet;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The options are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Initial level:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set the level which you will play at startup, from 1 (easiest) to 20 "
"(hardest). Default is level one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Direct drop down"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, pressing the <keysym>Down Arrow</keysym> will cause a tile to "
"immediately fall to the bottom of the screen. If unchecked, pressing the "
"<keysym>Down Arrow</keysym> only causes the piece to fall until the key is "
"released."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Old rotation style"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ksirtet; has two ways of rotating each piece: <quote>Old</quote> style and "
"<quote>New</quote> style. Each style uses a different point to rotate the "
"piece around. Try both, and see which one you prefer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable animations"
msgstr "Activar las animacions"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, pieces are shown with an animation (a small rebound effect), "
"when they touch the bottom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show piece's shadow"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, a shadow is placed beneath the game board showing where the "
"piece will fall."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show next piece"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "If checked, shows the next tile that will fall onto the game board."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show detailed \"removed lines\" field"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the <guilabel>Removed Lines</guilabel> counter on the left of "
"the screen shows how many times each number of lines have been removed. If "
"unchecked, just the total number removed is shown."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Fons"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the color and the opacity for &ksirtet; background. An opacity of "
"zero makes the &ksirtet; background completely transparent, and a setting of "
"one makes the &ksirtet; background completely opaque."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can select the colors used for the tiles in &ksirtet;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "A.I. Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can configure the A.I. in &ksirtet;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring Highscores"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The configuration is accessed from <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure Highscores...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The options "
"are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Main</guilabel> Tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:226 index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nickname:"
msgstr "Escais :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays your current nickname and allows you to change it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment"
msgstr "Comentari"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "A comment about yourself. You choose..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "World-wide high scores enabled"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked and if you are connected to the Internet, &ksirtet; will send "
"your score automatically at the end of the game to the high score web server "
"(ksirtet.sf.net)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> Tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab displays your <guilabel>Registration Data</guilabel> on ksirtet.sf."
"net:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays your current nickname from the <guilabel>Main</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Key:"
msgstr "Clau :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This key was generated when you registered on ksirtet.sf.net by selecting "
"<guilabel>World-wide high scores enabled</guilabel> the first time. The "
"registration key is used in conjunction with the nickname to identify "
"uniquely users, but users cannot have the same nickname. Click on the "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> button to delete you from the world highscores "
"list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiplayer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The multiplayer option allows you to play with others players on the same "
"computer. You can also play against an <acronym>AI</acronym> (artificial "
"intelligence) player which is currently not very good."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Basically when destroying lines, a player sends <quote>garbage</quote> at "
"the bottom of the game of his next opponent: nothing for one line destroyed, "
"one garbage line for two lines destroyed and so on."
msgstr ""

